This introduces support for an array variant (like Babel).

```json5
{
  "plugins": [
    // These two are equivalent
    "pixrem",
    ["postcss-pseudoelements", true],

    // Example passing configuration
    [
      "postcss-short-size",
      {
        "prefix": "xyz"
      }
    ]
  ]
}

```
